abstract: >-
  Continuous-time discrete-event simulation and retrospective
  time-indexed linear programming benchmarks for multi-type ICU
  bed allocation under resource scarcity, calibrated with
  DATASUS/CNES bed capacities (HU-UFMA) and AMIB/Epimed
  Brazilian ICU registry targets.
